Confirmed **VULN-20261029-001 (High)** — DOM XSS/token theft via `operator_page` and `deposit_url` on the sportsbook launch route. Runtime execution was proven (`XSS-CONFIRMED`, token `TESTTOKEN123` read from `sessionStorage`); evidence is in `result/findings/VULN-20261029-001/` and the entry is in `result/confirmed-vuln.txt`.

The only reachable route on `launch.sptpub.com` is `/brand/{id}/sportsbook/launch`; all other tested paths return CloudFront 403, and the sportsbook renderer/APIs are geo-blocked and out of scope. CloudFront rate-limited a burst (`bb-rsn: rl-m`), so further requests were paused and spaced.
